<title>USA: Peoples Bank raises div, sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Peoples Bank raises div, sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Bank Corp of Indianapolis on Thursday said its board of directors declared a two-for-one stock split, payable July 18 to shareholders of record on June 30.</p>
<p>The board also increased the quarterly cash dividend to $0.22 a share from $0.21. The cash dividend is payable July 18 to shareholders of record on June 30. On a split basis, the new dividend rate will be $0.11 a share, up from $0.105.</p>
</text>
